sequenceDiagram
    actor Student as 🖥️ Student Browser
    participant IP as Instruqt Proxy
    participant CC as cloud-client<br/>nginx
    participant GH as geekohive<br/>iptables DNAT
    participant HV as Harvester VIP<br/>192.168.122.11
    participant RN as Rancher NodePort<br/>192.168.122.9:30002
    participant PF as kubectl port-forward<br/>(challenge 06)
    participant NOC as alien-geeko<br/>LoadBalancer IP

    Note over Student,NOC: Harvester UI Tab (port 90)
    Student->>IP: HTTPS request
    IP->>CC: proxy to cloud-client:90
    CC->>GH: https://geekohive:8443
    GH->>HV: DNAT → .11:8443
    HV-->>Student: Harvester UI response

    Note over Student,NOC: Rancher UI Tab (port 91)
    Student->>IP: HTTPS request
    IP->>CC: proxy to cloud-client:91
    CC->>GH: https://geekohive:30002
    GH->>RN: DNAT → .9:30002
    RN-->>Student: Rancher UI response

    Note over Student,NOC: AeroGrid NOC Tab (port 92 — challenge 06)
    Student->>IP: HTTP request
    IP->>CC: proxy to cloud-client:92
    CC->>PF: kubectl port-forward 92:80
    PF->>NOC: checkin-cluster svc:80
    NOC-->>Student: Live cluster vitals
